# Development Guide

See also: `docs/agent-src/workflows.md` for a concise command reference.

## Prerequisites

- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/) — Python package manager
- [git](https://git-scm.com/downloads)
{% if include_typescript %}
- [{{ typescript_package_manager }}](https://{% if typescript_package_manager == "pnpm" %}pnpm.io{% elif typescript_package_manager == "bun" %}bun.sh{% else %}nodejs.org{% endif %}) — TypeScript package manager
{% endif %}
{% if include_java %}
- Java 21+ JDK
{% endif %}

See `docs/platforms.md` for platform-specific installation notes.

## Setup

```bash
git clone <repo-url>
cd {{ repo_slug }}
bash scripts/bootstrap.sh
```

Then add `scripts/` to your `PATH` as instructed.

## Quality Checks

```bash
croot check           # all checks: lint + typecheck + test
uv run nox -s lint    # lint only
{% if include_basedpyright %}uv run nox -s typecheck  # type check only
{% endif %}{% if include_pytest %}uv run nox -s test    # tests only
{% endif %}uv run nox -s format  # auto-format
```

## Dependency Management
{% if include_python %}
```bash
uv add <package>          # add runtime dependency
uv add --dev <package>    # add dev dependency
uv remove <package>       # remove dependency
uv sync                   # sync to lock file
uv lock --upgrade         # upgrade all dependencies
```
{% endif %}

## Template Updates

```bash
croot update
# or: bash scripts/update-template.sh
```

Review every changed file carefully before committing.
